                                "sense_id": "13985885-3a13-33cf-9432-5b19092dce08",
                                "text": "Die Frauen deiner Familie haben sich, so kommt es dir vor, nicht bewusst für oder gegen Kinder entschieden. Absolutes Wunschkind seist du gewesen, sagt dir deine Mutter.",
                                "translation": "It seems to you that the women in your family did not consciously decide for or against having children. You were absolutely a planned child, your mother tells you.",
